{
  "name": "Sanctuary II",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Acquired with CR 11 or higher. The target gains a +[POW mod] bonus to [Physical Defense] and [Magical Defense]. This effect lasts until the beginning of your next Main Process, or until the target leaves the square you are in.</p>\n<p>(SR2): Increase bonus to +[[POW mod] + 4].<br>(SR3): Increase bonus to +[[POW mod] + 8].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Magic that creates a sanctuary that wards off disasters and protects nearby allies. No matter what kind of hostility swirls on the battlefield, the sanctuary becomes a haven.</p>",
